<includeonly>{{#invoke:Outdated|getOutdatedFromSubpage}}</includeonly><noinclude>
== Usage ==
This template synchronizes the Outdated template from the "/Songs" subpage to display on the main page.

Simply use: <code><nowiki>{{Outdated/sync}}</nowiki></code>

The template will automatically:
# Look for the current page's "/Songs" subpage
# Find the <nowiki>{{Outdated}}</nowiki> template usage on that subpage
# Extract all parameters from that usage
# Display the same Outdated template on the main page with those parameters

This allows editors to only update the Outdated template on the "/Songs" subpage, and the main page will automatically stay synchronized.

== Example ==
If the "/Songs" subpage contains:
<pre>{{Outdated|January 15, 2024|bordercolor=#ff6b6b|discography=yes}}</pre>

Then using <code><nowiki>{{Outdated/sync}}</nowiki></code> on the main page will display the same Outdated template with those exact parameters.

